msgctxt "92"
msgid "I've been taking pole-dancing lessons recently."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Pole dancing? Oh, yeah, I heard about how the hostesses pole dance at that "
"club in Hatsumachi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Yeah. They say it's a pretty big hangout for a lot of politicians. I've "
"heard even Minister Tamiya was seen there once!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "You're kidding!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"I figure if I get a job there and work my butt off, I might get noticed by "
"a hot-shot politician! Then I can marry rich and never have to work another "
"day for as long as I live!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Wow! Good luck!"
msgstr ""

